    "detailed_description": "Master Cube is a 3d action platformer that's easy to learn and difficult to master. <br />\r\nWith original levels, and different styles of playing to becoming a professional Master Cube Player. <br />\r\nThis is a fast trial and error game, and at the same time, it's enjoyable and fun for all. <br />\r\nWithin this game, you will test your skills exceeding your limits such as dodging obstacles in your path by varying your speed or adapting yourself to more styles of play.<br />\r\nEach level has 3 different variations depending on the difficulty such as, level design, the damage and amount of enemies. <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy choose Master Cube? <br />\r\n- Different styles of playing<br />\r\n- Variety of levels <br />\r\n- Each level studied for its own difficulty<br />\r\n- The game adapts to your ability<br />\r\n- Hard to master, simple to play <br />\r\n- A lot of achievements<br />\r\n- Sometimes you will have to discover the path between light and darkness",
